server_deviation:
  The strategy's literal spawn command omits a Vite config. With the root config the demo page cannot fetch /stories/index.json, and /demo/audio/chibi/*.ogg answers with an HTML fallback, so the page never reaches ready and the byte cross-check cannot hold. The script therefore spawns node node_modules/vite/bin/vite.js --config vite.demo.config.ts --base /demo/ --port 5199 --strictPort --host 127.0.0.1 from the repo root. This keeps the required port, strictPort, host, cwd, page URL, /demo/audio/chibi/ row prefix, and real Ogg bytes. Recorded in plan.md T7.

